<section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__why">
      <div class="about__why-copy">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="about-title">
          A NEW WAY<br />
          TO PLAY.
        </h2>
        <p>
          The internet invents a fresh obsession every six months, and property
          trading just keeps outliving all of it. It was never about the
          cardboard houses. It was the people — the backstabs, the alliances
          that last a single round, the trade you brag about for months
          afterwards.
        </p>
        <p>
          Akipoly takes that feeling and rebuilds it for the screen, on Arc,
          with the same friends you already yell at across real tables.
          Everything that made the original dangerous — the scheming, the
          laughing, the rent arriving at the worst possible moment — kept.
          Everything that didn't fit in 2026 — gone with the cardboard.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="details" aria-labelledby="details-title">
        <p class="details__title" id="details-title">The Details</p>
        <ul class="details__list">
          <li class="details__item">
            <span class="details__key">ON ARC</span>
            <span class="details__value">
              Every roll, trade and takeover lives on Arc — on the record,
              yours to prove.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="details__item">
            <span class="details__key">WITH YOUR PEOPLE</span>
            <span class="details__value">
              Private rooms for the usual suspects. Same board, better trash
              talk.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="details__item">
            <span class="details__key">YOURS TO KEEP</span>
            <span class="details__value">
              What's bought is bought. Properties, pieces and wins live with
              you, not a landlord's spreadsheet.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="about__cards">
      <article class="card card--lift feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" style="background:#B8F28B">
          <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none" stroke="#171717" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 15 15 4l11 11" />
            <path d="M7.5 12.5V25h15V12.5" />
            <path d="M12.5 25v-6h5v6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">BUY</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__copy">
          Claim your place on the board. Snap up properties before someone
          else parks their flag on them.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card card--lift feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" style="background:#9DB7FB">
          <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none" stroke="#171717" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="4" y="17" width="10" height="9" rx="1.5" />
            <rect x="16" y="17" width="10" height="9" rx="1.5" />
            <rect x="10" y="4" width="10" height="9" rx="1.5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">BUILD</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__copy">
          Turn your moves into an empire. Stack houses, stack hotels, stare
          smugly at the skyline.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card card--lift feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" style="background:#FF80B5">
          <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none" stroke="#171717" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M9.5 4h11v6a5.5 5.5 0 0 1-11 0V4Z" />
            <path d="M9.5 6.5H5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.9 4.5M20.5 6.5H25a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-4.9 4.5" />
            <path d="M15 15.5V20M10.5 26h9M12 20h6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">COMPETE</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__copy">
          Challenge your friends. One winner, plenty of betrayed alliances,
          zero mercy on rent day.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
